Install prerequisites: Node.js (18+), MongoDB (or use Atlas), Python 3.9+ (for predictor).

Backend:

cd backend

create .env from .env.example and set MONGODB_URI, JWT_SECRET

npm install

npm run seed

npm run dev (server at http://localhost:5000)

Frontend:

cd frontend

npm install

set VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000 in .env if needed

npm run dev (frontend at http://localhost:5173 or port shown)

Price predictor:

cd price_predictor

pip install -r requirements.txt

python predictor.py train

then python predictor.py 7 to predict for month 7 (illustrative)

Use Postman / browser to test endpoints.
